# Netlify Site Sync Rule

## CRITICAL: Two-Repository Architecture

This project uses TWO separate Git repositories:

1. **divine-link** (this repo): Main macOS app code
   - Path: `/Users/ayoogunrekun/Projects/Divine Link`
   - Contains: Swift code, Xcode project, Distribution/netlify-site (source files)

2. **divine-link-site** (separate repo): Netlify website deployment
   - Path: `/Users/ayoogunrekun/Projects/divine-link-site`
   - Deploys to: https://divinelink.netlify.app
   - Files: admin.html, index.html, appcast.xml, etc.

## Automatic Sync Requirement

**When ANY file in `Distribution/netlify-site/` is modified:**

1. ALWAYS copy the modified file(s) to `/Users/ayoogunrekun/Projects/divine-link-site/`
2. ALWAYS commit and push from the divine-link-site directory
3. NEVER rely on pushing from /tmp clones - use the local authenticated repo

## Sync Command

After modifying files in Distribution/netlify-site/, run:

```bash
# Copy all netlify-site files to the website repo
cp -R "/Users/ayoogunrekun/Projects/Divine Link/Distribution/netlify-site/"* /Users/ayoogunrekun/Projects/divine-link-site/

# Commit and push from the website repo
cd /Users/ayoogunrekun/Projects/divine-link-site
git add -A
git commit -m "Sync from Divine Link: <describe changes>"
git push origin main
```

Or use the sync script:
```bash
/Users/ayoogunrekun/Projects/Divine\ Link/scripts/sync-netlify-site.sh "Commit message"
```

## File Mapping

| Source (Divine Link)                          | Destination (divine-link-site)     |
|-----------------------------------------------|-------------------------------------|
| Distribution/netlify-site/admin.html          | admin.html                          |
| Distribution/netlify-site/index.html          | index.html                          |
| Distribution/netlify-site/appcast.xml         | appcast.xml                         |
| Distribution/netlify-site/netlify.toml        | netlify.toml                        |
| Distribution/netlify-site/privacy.html        | privacy.html                        |
| Distribution/netlify-site/terms.html          | terms.html                          |
| Distribution/netlify-site/success.html        | success.html                        |
| Distribution/netlify-site/releases/*          | releases/*                          |

## Verification

After syncing, verify deployment at:
- Netlify Dashboard: https://app.netlify.com/projects/divinelink
- Live Site: https://divinelink.netlify.app/admin.html

Check deployment status:
```bash
cd /Users/ayoogunrekun/Projects/divine-link-site && netlify status
```
